 "description": "KYA (Know Your Agent): 10-factor on-chain reputation scoring. Evaluates transaction volume, balances, token diversity, DeFi interactions, cross-chain intel, and risk flags. Returns trust score (0-100) and trust level. ERC-8004 compatible. Scope: Agent or wallet collaboration trust and reputation signals, including ERC-8004-compatible evidence. Use this before relying on another Agent. It is not a wallet's financial activity score (wallet.credit_score), a registered identity card (agent.card.lookup), or proof that the subject is a verified person or organization.",
 "execution": {
  "taskSupport": "forbidden"
 },
